ning of the week, with office hours running later in the week to reinforce =
and extend what you=E2=80=99ve learned.Subscribing to the course calendar. =
You can subscribe to the course calendar directly from the Maven portal. Th=
is will put the office hours and any other live workshops on your calendar.=
 See the screenshot below or follow this guide for how to subscribe to the =
course calendar.DelphiEvery student in this cohort will receive ten months =
of unlimited access to Delphi, our AI eval assistant trained on the complet=
e body of our work. Invitations will be sent to your Maven email later this=
 week; if you do not receive one by October 10, contact Alan at alan@parlan=
ce-labs.com. Do not email me or Hamel=E2=80=94your email will probably get =
