add you to the roster for the later cohort.Technical support. Contact suppo=
rt@maven.com for enrollment or payment issues, and contact alan@parlance-la=
bs.com for Discord or Delphi access.That=E2=80=99s everything you need to g=
et started. Please post in Discord if you have any questions. It=E2=80=99s =
going to be an awesome course! Get excited!Best,Shreya and Hamel
